This function is already minimal; the only micro-optimization is to replace the short-circuiting `&&` with a branchless bitwise `&`, avoiding a conditional branch in the hot decode path.

```cpp
FIT_BOOL DeveloperFieldDefinition::IsDefined() const
{
    return static_cast<FIT_BOOL>((nullptr != mesg) & (nullptr != developer));
}
```
